			"Message": "refactor(Mountain): Consolidate search dispatch arms into SearchRouter, apply style pass\n\nConsolidate the half-dozen `search:*` match arms in DispatchMatch.rs into a single delegated route via SearchRouter::route, moving inline cancellation-logic (`search:cancel`) and no-op ack stubs (`search:clearCache`, `search:onDidChangeResult`) behind the router abstraction. The new dispatch line follows the established `unwrap_or_else(|| Ok(Value::Null))` fallback pattern used by other subsystem routers.\n\nFix an import-ordering issue where `use super::*;` appeared before sibling imports, causing resolution ambiguity — move it after all explicit `use` statements so the shadowed ExternalModule bindings take precedence.\n\nApply a companion style pass across TauriIPCServer.rs (collapse StartHealthMonitoring body), DispatchMatch.rs (tighter match arm bodies, blank-line separators in resolve_route_tier arms), and mod.rs (compact param spacing, remove extraneous blank lines between module declarations).\n\nPure structural simplification — no behavioural change to search dispatch, cancellation, or ack semantics.",
